# block-string-header-comment

## Input

```
f | # comment
  content

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..24
  ENTRY@0..24
    WORD_KEY@0..1
      WORD@0..1 "f"
    SPACE@1..2 " "
    BLOCK_STRING@2..24
      BLOCK_STRING_HEADER@2..14
        PIPE@2..3 "|"
        COMMENT@3..13 " # comment"
        NEWLINE@13..14 "\n"
      SPACE@14..16 "  "
      LINE_STRING@16..23
        STRING@16..23 "content"
      NEWLINE@23..24 "\n"
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@0..1 "f",
            },
            value: BlockString {
                header: BlockStringHeader {
                    style: PIPE@2..3 "|",
                    indent: none,
                    chomp: none,
                },
                lines: [
                    LineString {
                        string: STRING@16..23 "content",
                    },
                ],
            },
        },
    ],
}
```

